# Testing & evals

- Do not claim done without evidence (command output)
- Deterministic clocks/random in brain and decision tests
- Unit tests for decision/throttle/classifier/surface logic
- `npm run eval` for scenario timelines (allowed vs forbidden decisions)
- Release path: `npm run package` (includes hard commit-detect) then after Reload `ORBITAL_LIVE=1 npm run verify:release` when git/celebrations/packaging changed
- Substantial features: always run `orbital-verifier` in a separate context
